# GAMS / DECIS runtime artifacts written to the repo root when a solve is run
# from the project directory (Sprint 37 Day 9: a `git add -A` swept 20 of these
# into a commit, including `decis.lic` and DECIS solver output carrying a
# third-party copyright header). These are generated, never source.
MINOS.SPC
MODEL.*
decis.lic
decism.opt
solution_lic.csv
listA1.csv
repdat.put
*.SOL
*.SCR
*.STG
*.STO

# GAMS artifacts written by corpus model sources themselves (dyncge, epscm,
# qp1x, scenmerge all `execute_unload "result.gdx"`), so a pipeline run from the
# repo root drops one here.
result.gdx
